              "text" : "Dear {!$Expression.First_Name} {!$Expression.Last_Name_2},<br /><br />Choosing a high school is a major decision. As you consider your options, ask what each school will offer your student during these important years. At Zeta High, the answers begin with <strong>purpose, passion, and power.<br /></strong><br /><strong>Will I be known and supported?</strong><br />High school brings greater freedom, but students should never have to navigate it alone. Every Zeta High student belongs to a 12-student Z Pod led by a dedicated Z Coach who knows them deeply. Cross-grade Z Houses create friendship, mentorship, and a strong sense of belonging.<br />"
            },
            "definition" : "lightning/paragraph",
            "id" : "4f031ac7-15f4-485d-b7ae-6a67b6486735",
            "type" : "block"
          } ]
