              "text" : "<strong>Will I become more independent?</strong><br />Students learn to set goals, manage their time, advocate for themselves, and make thoughtful decisions. Zeta provides clear expectations and caring guidance while giving students increasing responsibility for their education and their future.<br /><br />Zeta High is a tuition-free, college-preparatory public charter school built around what we know students are capable of achieving. Here, students are known, challenged, and empowered to shape a powerful future of their own choosing. <br /><br /><a href=\"https://zetaschools.org/events-for-prospective-families/\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer\"><u>Sign up for an upcoming event or tour</u></a> to experience Zeta High for yourself.  <br /><br />Warmly,<br /><strong>The Zeta Enrollment Team</strong><br />Zeta Charter Schools<br />"
            },
